For now, XDP_RING_NEED_WAKEUP is not supported properly by the virtio-net
in the tx path for example: we set xsk_set_tx_need_wakeup() in
virtnet_xsk_xmit(), but we didn't call xsk_clear_tx_need_wakeup()
