+ * Selects the role the XPCS plays in protocols that have an asymmetric
+ * AN code word (Cisco SGMII / QSGMII / USXGMII). Drives
+ * VR_MII_AN_CTRL.TX_CONFIG: 0 means the local end receives the partner's
